# Rentrix Core Rule

- The active application is `rentrix-app/`.
- Before any non-trivial edit, read `docs/ai/CURRENT_EXECUTION_CONTEXT.md`.
- Follow `docs/ai/AGENT_OPERATING_PROTOCOL.md` as the unified shared operating protocol.
- Keep Rentrix single-office, Arabic-first with safe English/LTR behavior.
- Do not expand scope or change Supabase, production configuration, credentials, migrations, RLS, RPCs, auth, or environment behavior without explicit approval.
- Do not reintroduce `react-router-dom`, `useApp`, `AppContext`, or `dataService` into runtime.
- Use `rg` and `rg --files` for inspection.
- Review the diff and run relevant verification before claiming completion.
